OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for trying to murder
OL,4,Atoddler by giving her adult medication
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who attempted to murder a
OL,7,Ftoddler by repeatedly giving her adult
OL,8,Fmedication has been jailed for a
OL,9,Fminimum of six years.
OL,11,FLaura Docherty, 35, formerly of
OL,12,FGlenrothes, gave the girl
OL,13,Fantidepressant and painkilling drugs
OL,14,Fresulting in her needing to be
OL,15,Fresuscitated and placed on a
OL,16,Fventilator.
OL,18,FA judge at the High Court in Edinburgh
OL,19,Fimposed an order for lifelong
OL,20,Frestriction and ordered that Docherty
OL,21,Fmust serve a minimum of six years in
OL,22,Fjail before seeking parole.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
