OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for trying to murder
OL,4,Atoddler by giving her adult medication
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Michael O'Grady KC said: "The
OL,7,Fword 'wicked' is an old fashioned word,
OL,8,Fbut there are times when no other word
OL,9,Fwill suffice."
